---
// The first thing you read inside the forest. src/scripts/forest.ts splits
// the paragraph into words and lights them one by one as you scroll past;
// without script (or with reduced motion) the text is simply fully lit.
---

<section class="f-manifesto" aria-label="About ClarityScale">
  <div class="f-wrap">
    <p class="f-eyebrow">The studio</p>
    <p class="f-manifesto__text" data-f-words>
      We're a small studio that designs and builds for businesses with <em>somewhere to go.</em>
      Clear thinking, honest prices, and websites that keep earning long after launch day. Every
      project is <em>made by hand</em>, from the first sketch to the last line of code.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>
